 .edu/s/event?EventID=48801\n\nThe acclaimed Stanford Afro-Latin Jazz Ensem
 ble\, directed by Murray Low\, presents their first performance of the aca
 demic year! We are excited to playing for you again.  As usual\, the group
  has a complete new set of music prepared covering all aspects of the idio
 m - classic and modern salsa\, boleros\, samba\, rumba\, Latin jazz\, and 
 much more! Works include those written or performed by icons such as Rubé
 n Blades\, Los Van Van\, Celia Cruz\, Elis Regina\, Gilberto Gil\, and eve
 n Michael Jackson! There is something for everyone. The music is guarantee
 d to perk up your ears - and dancing in the aisles is encouraged.\n\nAdmis
 sion Information\n\nGeneral – $32 | Seniors (65+) and Non-Stanford Stude
 nts – $27\nPrice shown reflects total cost including $4 online/phone per
